"doc":"The finite collection of ideals summed over. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.QChebyshevFunction.Lambda_q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.QChebyshevFunction.Lambda_q","kind":"def","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AlgebraicSubstrate/QChebyshevFunction.lean#L48-L48","doc":"q-von Mangoldt weight `Λ_q(𝔪)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.QChebyshevFunction.N","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.QChebyshevFunction.N","kind":"def","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AlgebraicSubstrate/QChebyshevFunction.lean#L46-L46","doc":"Norm `N(𝔪)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.QChebyshevFunction.Idx","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.QChebyshevFunction.Idx","kind":"def","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AlgebraicSubstrate/QChebyshevFunction.lean#L44-L44","doc":"Index type for the maximal ideals `𝔪`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.QChebyshevFunction.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.QChebyshevFunction.mk","kind":"ctor","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AlgebraicSubstrate/QChebyshevFunction.lean#L42-L42","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.QChebyshevFunction","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.QChebyshevFunction","kind":"structure","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AlgebraicSubstrate/QChebyshevFunction.lean#L37-L55","doc":"Data for the q-Chebyshev function `ψ_q`.\n\nA `definition` carrier: over a finite collection `ideals` of maximal\nideals with norm `N` and q-von Mangoldt weight `Lambda_q`, `psi_q X`\nis pinned to the sum of the weights over those ideals of norm `≤ X`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:q-chebyshev-function","label":"def:q-chebyshev-function","md":"quantum-observable-universe/q-geometric-langlands/q-chebyshev-function.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}